To make the check robust against potential casing variations in the backend error message (e.g., "Transaction has expired"), it is safer to perform a case-insensitive substring search by converting the exception string to lowercase.

```suggestion
    if isinstance(exc, exceptions.InvalidArgument):
        return _EXPIRED_TRANSACTION_MESSAGE in str(exc).lower()
```
